            titleTarget +
            "\". The goal: by the end they can say all of it properly, out loud, with no mistakes. The app keeps the checklist; you follow it:\n" +
            rows +
            "\nYou are on challenge " +
            (now + 1) +
            ". The APP judges every answer: each of their turns reaches you with a note. A TRY gets a result (NOT YET, ONCE MORE or DONE) and what to say. A turn that was not a try — they were just talking with you, asked you something, asked for help, or said it in their own language — gets a note saying so: answer it as their conversation partner, and help. Follow the notes, and never judge an answer yourself." +
            fixes

